OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F166A1794284725
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FMainly fine with variable
OL,6,Fcloud during the morning, before a
OL,7,Fweakening band of cloud and showery
OL,8,Frain moves slowly southwards through
OL,9,Feastern parts later. Temperatures near
OL,10,Fnormal, colder by evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FTurning brighter, clearer and colder
OL,14,Ffor a time from Thursday, with sunny
OL,15,Fperiods but also a cold wind and sharp
OL,16,Fovernight frosts. Turning less cold
OL,17,Fbut more unsettled through Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
